<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="consentForm.css">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<title>Doctor Consent Form</title>
</head>
<body>
    <script src="/src/app/jsfilesCreated/consent.js" defer></script>
    <form class="consent-form" id="patientConsentForm" action="/consentform" method="POST">
 
        <legend><b>Consent</b></legend>
        <fieldset>
            <p>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Procedure-Specific Risks</b>: Any complications or side effects associated with the specific medical procedures being performed.</li>
                    <li><b>Medication Risks</b>: Possible adverse reactions to medications that may be administered, including allergies and interactions with other drugs.</li>
                    <li><b>Diagnostic Risks</b>: Complications that could arise from diagnostic tests, such as infections from blood draws or reactions to contrast dyes used in imaging.</li>
                    <li><b>Treatment Risks</b>: Potential for treatment failure, need for additional treatments, or the occurrence of unexpected complications.</li>
                    <li><b>Infection Risks</b>: The possibility of acquiring an infection while in the care facility.</li>
                    <li><b>Anesthesia Risks</b>: If applicable, the risks associated with anesthesia, including allergic reactions and respiratory issues.</li>
                    <li><b>Consent Withdrawal</b>: The patient’s right to withdraw consent at any time and the potential consequences of doing so.</li>
                </ul>
            </p>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="patient-name"><b>Patient Name</b>:</label>
                <input type="text" id="patient-name" name="patient_name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="date"><b>Today's Date</b>: (MM/DD/YYYY)</label>
                <input type="text" id="date" name="date" required>
            </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset>
            <p>
                By checking this box, I acknowledge that I have read and understood the information provided about routine medical procedures. I authorize the medical team to administer the prescribed medications and perform necessary tests as part of my treatment plan. I understand the purpose and potential risks associated with these interventions, and I agree to proceed with the full knowledge of these factors.
            </p>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="confirm" class="fixedwidth">Yes, I agree with the terms</label>
                <input type="checkbox" name="confirm" id="confirm"/>
            </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="button" class="fixedwidth">
            <!-- Custom Button -->
           <button type="button" class="custom-button" id="submitButton" disabled>Submit</button>
        </div>
    
    </form>
</body>
</html>
